%%PageBoundingBox:    0     0   888   378
%%BeginPageSetup
N
0 0 M
888 0 L
888 378 L
0 378 L
cp
clip
1.00 GC
0 378 888 378 888 0 3 0 0 DPLF
[     1 0 0    -1 0   375] CT
